('generated',(Q,9),row('CheckoutItemRequest is selection-only positional contract ProductId,optional VariantId,Quantity,requested offer and Notes;no name/unitprice/station copied from client. Generated constructor/with accepts any quantity or mismatched variant;MenuPricingService.ResolveAsync supplies server catalog/offer validation,so constructor is not financial boundary. Scalar/string record equality compares exact selected fields,including notes;it is not product-only cart grouping identity. Generated ToString exposes free-text notes.', 'Product/variant IDs,int quantity,offer ID?,notes?.','JSON selected line;not frozen priced OrderItem.','Allocation only,no menu lookup/stock deduction.','Client-supplied selection authorized/validated server-side;record equality never authenticates product price.','Checkout handler57 calls pricing before transaction;record no SQL.','Notes reach kitchen/customer tickets after server composition;selection does not itself print.','Small value-reference record;no deep collections.','with copy may alter quantity after request captured if caller replaces line;existing containing list alias separate concern.','No business invariant in record constructor.',['Invalid variant/product,quantity bounds,expired offer and note-bearing equality/copy fixtures'],['CheckoutOrderRequest.cs9-10','CheckoutOrderHandler.cs57','MenuPricingService.ResolveAsync'])),
('generated',(Q,14),row('CheckoutSplitRequest holds Method and AmountPiastres as plain string/long. Generated init/copy performs no whitelist,positive amount,sum-to-order or electronic-leg limit. Checkout maps each to concrete PaymentMethod/Money then domain split rules authorize shape;multi is not legitimate leg despite constructor accepting that text. Value equality compares one leg only and cannot prove whole payment balanced. No account/confirmation token included.','Method string,long amount from client list.','Serialized concrete payment leg selection.','No collection/ledger movement from construction.','Untrusted method/amount boundary;real guards in mapping/domain not record.','Checkout split mapping71+ then domain transaction;record no DB.','Preview split not confirmed payment/physical cash.','Constant scalar copy/hash;arithmetic elsewhere.','Duplicate equal legs not deduped by record or serializer;list semantics/domain decide.','Payload may contain negative/unknown method until handler rejects.',['multi/negative/duplicate legs,sum mismatch,pending electronic plus cash and roundtrip'],['CheckoutOrderRequest.cs14','CheckoutOrderHandler.cs71+','Domain.Orders.CheckoutRules split validation'])),
('generated',(Q,21),row('CheckoutOrderRequest holds stable CheckoutRequestId,claimed cashier/shift/day,selection Items,discount/comp/payment,split-list,customer/address/service fields and optional print route/pickup time. Generated properties preserve readonly-interface list references without deep freeze;with-copy changes scalar request while retaining original Items/SplitPayments references. Handler independently resolves prices,composes structured address,checks actor/shift/day/payment/comp and uses ID for replay;record equality/list identity is not idempotency payload equivalence. Optional tail defaults preserve older JSON/callers but do not prove correct route/time. Generated ToString includes customer/address and approval IDs,so not sanitized logging.','Full request fields21-71;Items required,SplitPayments nullable,delivery/comp/route/pickup optional.','Checkout command JSON;not actual Order or committed state.','Allocation/copy only;handler can create sale/stock/treasury/print jobs separately.','Body CashierId SEC001 sink remains;claim fields not authenticated by constructor. Structured delivery input must be validated server,raw DeliveryAddress compatibility not trusted persisted source.','CheckoutOrderHandler transaction/replay and pricing source already accepted;DTO itself no SQL.','CustomerPrintRoute limits validated in handler,not arbitrary printer send from generated property;pickup time nullable not unpaid pickup state.','Serialization proportional Items/Splits/notes;shallow equality not content hash or safe retained request snapshot.','Same CheckoutRequestId with changed record fields remains server replay key;with-copy does not mint new operation. Mutable backing list can change captured payload if caller reuses it.',['Deep immutability not guaranteed by record/IReadOnlyList','No current copying mutation reproduced'],['Serialize captured request then mutate list,with-copy key preservation,missing optional tail,crossfield/payment/comp guards and SEC001 casing isolated harness only'],['CheckoutOrderRequest.cs21-71','CheckoutOrderHandler.HandleAsync','CashierViewModel.Checkout request construction/retention','accepted Program checkout route/FIN001+002 flows'])),
('generated',(Q,73),row('CheckoutOrderResult transports committed order identity/sequence,total,paid/change,status,IsPaid,electronic status,replay and PrintJobsQueued defaulttrue. Generated scalar constructor cannot enforce status-money consistency;with-copy can manufacture display states but does not alter sale. PrintJobsQueued distinguishes sale success from subsequent ticket enqueue failure,not paper output. Legacy omitted field defaults true,so backward compatibility is not independent evidence tickets exist. Value equality captures snapshot only while electronic status may later change.','Eleven output fields,PrintJobsQueued optional defaulttrue.','Serialized checkout acknowledgement.','No money/print side effect from result object.','Server result should be trusted only through valid authenticated transport;public constructor not proof transaction committed.','Handler builds after commit/replay;queue follow-up separate per source result contract.','Success may need manual print recovery;WasReplayed not a second sale;IsPaid cannot be inferred from queued slip.','Constant scalar properties;no DB status refresh generated.','Copy preserves orderID but can alter flags;must not use result record equality as durable operation ID.','Default true cannot prove queue status for stale backend response.',['PrintJobsQueued false sale remains committed,legacy missing true,confirmed later order differs snapshot,no physical print'],['CheckoutOrderRequest.cs73-88','CheckoutOrderHandler result/replay and print enqueue','CashierViewModel.Checkout result display'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Orders/ConfirmElectronicPaymentRequest.cs',7),row('ConfirmElectronicPaymentRequest has only OrderId and claimed CashierId;no amount,method,provider receipt or new request ID. Generated constructor/value copy adds no payment verification. Handler derives actual pending electronic leg from locked order,requires pos/cash_drawer_sale and open shift,and status supplies idempotency. with-copy CashierId changes claim rather than authenticated principal,SEC001 boundary. Equality of request is neither evidence money arrived nor a registry receipt.','OrderId,CashierId strings.','JSON instruction to confirm stored electronic leg.','No confirmation until handler invoked.','No provider callback signature;operator confirmation under actor permission,body identity validated separately.','ConfirmElectronicPaymentHandler25-100 locks order/posts deferred sale;FIN001 collision remains.','Does not itself auto-release held kitchen tickets,existing FLOW002;no direct printer.','Small scalar record;server lookup/hash no generated behavior.','Repeated equal request relies order status,not record equality or unique request key;changed actor same OrderId still same underlying event.','Client cannot supply settled amount via this contract,positive counterevidence.',['Same order repeated,different actor,alreadyconfirmed,FIN001 split conflict,invalid/no electronic leg'],['ConfirmElectronicPaymentRequest.cs7','ConfirmElectronicPaymentHandler.cs25-110','Program confirm endpoint','FLOW002'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Orders/ConfirmElectronicPaymentRequest.cs',9),row('ConfirmElectronicPaymentResult reports OrderId,ElectronicPaymentStatus,IsPaid,nullable TreasuryMovementId and WasReplayed. Generated constructor/copy does not enforce confirmed implies nonnull movement;replay builder queries first sale_collection and can return null. Result cannot distinguish immediate mixed cash movement from deferred electronic movement solely by generic ID,so no claim complete financial proof. Scalar equality only response snapshot.','Five handler-derived fields.','Confirmation acknowledgement/replay.','No financial write in generated record.','Caller must not treat edited result as authority;server movement/status authoritative.','BuildReplayResult103-110 queries existing movement;constructor no DB.','Payment-confirm UI may refresh actual order/print state;response not physical payment or kitchen release proof.','Constant field access,no implicit query.','with copy changes display flags only;WasReplayed not amount attributed to electronic leg.','Nullable movement and generic sale_collection query limit reconciliation certainty.',['Replay with no movement,split cash+electronic first movement,flags after concurrent refund'],['ConfirmElectronicPaymentRequest.cs9-10','ConfirmElectronicPaymentHandler.BuildReplayResultAsync103-110','FIN001 source trace'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Orders/CancelPendingElectronicPaymentRequest.cs',8),row('CancelPendingElectronicPaymentRequest carries OrderId,Reason and claimed CashierId,without refund amount or request ID. Generated constructor accepts empty reason but Order.CancelElectronicPayment validates pending leg/reason;handler authorizes pos/cash_drawer_sale and locks order. No generated member reverses cash/stock. FIN002 mixed pending cancellation can retain immediate cash movement while cancelled sales omitted reports;record name does not guarantee no money was collected.','OrderId,Reason,CashierId strings.','JSON pending-claim cancellation instruction.','Allocation only;handler writes status/audit,not treasury reversal.','Body CashierId SEC001 sink;reason free text can appear in ToString/audit.','CancelPendingElectronicPaymentHandler35-84 locked transaction;record no SQL.','Cancel is not refund;UI must not infer mixed cash leg reversed or kitchen stock returned.','Scalar copy,reason string potential large payload.','Status-based replay,not request equality;different reason retry after cancellation may preserve original state.','Summary comment no money ever collected fails mixed-leg scenario,FIN002 retained.',['Mixed cash+InstaPay cancel cash conservation,confirmed blocked,empty reason and repeated same/different reason'],['CancelPendingElectronicPaymentRequest.cs8','CancelPendingElectronicPaymentHandler.cs35-84','Order.CancelElectronicPayment','FIN002'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Orders/CancelPendingElectronicPaymentRequest.cs',10),row('CancelPendingElectronicPaymentResult exposes OrderId,order Status,electronic status and WasReplayed but no money/stock movement reversal fields. All scalar strings/bool generated semantics cannot certify financial settlement or kitchen cancellation. Handler returns actual persisted status after transaction,where WasReplayed tracks prior cancelled order;it may still increment Version/save on no-op. Generated equality does not distinguish such persistence activity.','Four cancellation output fields.','JSON status acknowledgement.','No mutation by record itself.','Server result only status,not evidence customer refunded;do not trust client-created copy.','Handler result83+ follows Save/Commit;record no SQL.','Cancelled UI label insufficient financial net zero,FIN002;no ticket recall acknowledgement.','Constant scalar operations.','with copy statuses not revalidated;repeated response same except replay flag.','Result lacks actual cash reversal/inventory-reversal evidence by design.',['Repeated cancelled shows WasReplayed,FIN002 status versus retained cash,confirmed cannot cancel'],['CancelPendingElectronicPaymentRequest.cs10-11','CancelPendingElectronicPaymentHandler.cs74-84','FIN002'])),
('generated',('src/Falah.Application/Orders/RefundOrderRequest.cs',5),row('RefundOrderRequest holds RefundRequestId,OrderId,Amount,Reason,claimed CashierId and optional approval pair. Compiler constructor/init/with validates neither positive amount nor approval binding;RefundOrderHandler/Order.ApplyRefund cap remaining and use transaction/source account balance. Same key must survive retry;with-copy amount/order retaining ID can replay prior result rather than new refund. FIN003 unpaid/COD and FIN004 operational shift remain source behavior,not remedied by record. ToString exposes free-text reason/approval IDs.','Seven request scalars/nullable strings.','JSON refund command;not immutable refund event.','No refund until handler validates/posts.','Body CashierId privilege sink;approval token separately registry checked. Caller lacks direct source account/operational shift field,derived server-side.','RefundOrderHandler locking/journal/movement;record no SQL.','UI amount is piastres,not units or EGPlong;request no inventory line return/print command.','Small record/string serialization.','Idempotency key independent from generated value equality;copy altered payload same ID must not imply new command.','No IsPaid constructor predicate;upstream FIN003.' ,['Same key changed amount/order,unpaid refund,cumulative cap,approval mismatch,old sale current operational shift'],['RefundOrderRequest.cs5-12','RefundOrderHandler.HandleAsync45-174','Order.ApplyRefund220-233','FIN003/FIN004'])),
